ipfw(8)/dnctl(8): "type cake" scheduler parameters, display and manual.

Made against opnsense/src stable/26.7 (01510f09); apply with
"patch -p1" in /usr/src.

diff --git a/sbin/ipfw/dummynet.c b/sbin/ipfw/dummynet.c
